OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785266323
OL,3,CFrench wildfire smoke prompts 'panic'
OL,4,C150 kilometres away
OL,6,FChannel Islanders living in south-west
OL,7,FFrance say the devastating wildfire
OL,8,Fnear Bordeaux has left them in a state
OL,9,Fof "panic".
OL,11,FAround 220,000 people based in the
OL,12,FGironde region have evacuated their
OL,13,Fhomes since the start of the fire,
OL,14,Fwhich has burned 42,000 hectares - an
OL,15,Farea four times the size of Paris.
OL,17,FITV Channel has been speaking to
OL,18,Fresidents in the village of Fongrave,
OL,19,Fwhich is around 150 kilometres from
OL,20,Fthe fire and they say it feels much
OL,21,Fcloser to home.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
