FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785266323
OL,3,CFrench wildfire smoke prompts 'panic'
OL,4,C150 kilometres away
OL,6,FThey reference the strong smell of
OL,7,Fsmoke and that the sun is even a
OL,8,Fdifferent colour as a result of the
OL,9,Fblazes, which one French minister told
OL,10,Fjournalists "has a life of its own".
OL,12,FSimon Tanguy, an expat from Guernsey,
OL,13,Fsays learning of the spread was
OL,14,Ffrightening.
OL,16,FHe explains: "(There was) panic
OL,17,Finitially. Obviously, we were aware of
OL,18,Fthe fires on the west coast near
OL,19,FBordeaux and that they've been going
OL,20,Ffor a couple of weeks.
OL,26,@xD@OpmxD@Ypn
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785266323
OL,3,CFrench wildfire smoke prompts 'panic'
OL,4,C150 kilometres away
OL,6,F"We're surrounded by forest, farmland
OL,7,Fetc., all of which is very, very crisp
OL,8,Fand dry. So when you smell smoke, it
OL,9,Fdoes tend to make you panic. You want
OL,10,Fto know what's going on elsewhere."
OL,12,FHe added: "Whilst it's nerve wracking
OL,13,Fhere, it must be terrifying nearer the
OL,14,Ffire."
OL,16,FAnother expat, Carla Tanguy, told ITV
OL,17,FNews that the community in Fongrave
OL,18,Fhas been donating essential supplies
OL,19,Fto support the efforts of local
OL,20,Ffirefighters and those who have been
OL,21,Fdisplaced.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785266323
OL,3,CFrench wildfire smoke prompts 'panic'
OL,4,C150 kilometres away
OL,6,FShe says: "They've literally left with
OL,7,Ftheir 'go' bag which is their ID,
OL,8,Fphone and phone charger, and
OL,9,Fgenerally, one set of clothes and
OL,10,Fthey've got nothing else."
OL,12,FSandy Ozanne, who owns a local bed and
OL,13,Fbreakfast, says holidaymakers have
OL,14,Fbeen struck by how the fires are
OL,15,Fimpacting the local environment.
OL,17,FShe explains: "The sun has got an
OL,18,Forange aura around it which is really
OL,19,Fweird. It's not the sun as we know it.
OL,20,FIt's the sun through some awful smoke
OL,21,Fcloud."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/4
